        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Korn\n- Products: “Falling Away from Me”, “Issues”\n- Organizations: Comedy Central\n- Events: “Korn’s Groovy Pirate Ghost Mystery” episode\n- Topics: single releases, television debuts\n\nFacts:\n- Korn is an American band.\n- “Falling Away from Me” is a rock song by Korn.\n- “Falling Away from Me” was released as the first single from Korn’s fourth album, “Issues.”\n- “Falling Away from Me” debuted in Comedy Central’s animated series “South Park.”\n- The “South Park” episode featuring the song is titled “Korn’s Groovy Pirate Ghost Mystery.”\n- “Korn’s Groovy Pirate Ghost Mystery” was the tenth episode of “South Park” season three and the 41st episode overall.",
